Technology Stack

Frontend

•	Framework: React with Next.js
•	Language: TypeScript
•	Styling: Tailwind CSS
•	Animations: Framer Motion
•	State Management: React Context API / Redux (as needed)
•	Routing: Next.js App Router
•	API Communication: Fetch API / Axios
•	Authentication: Firebase Authentication (client-side SDK)
•	Form Handling: React Hook Form (recommended)
•	Data Visualization: Chart.js / Recharts (for analytics and charts)
•	Code Editor: Monaco Editor / CodeMirror (for coding workspace)
•	UI Components: Custom components with Tailwind CSS
•	Responsive Design: Tailwind CSS responsive utilities
•	Testing: Jest / React Testing Library (recommended)




Backend
•	Language: Python
•	Framework: FastAPI / Django / Flask (recommended: FastAPI for modern APIs)
•	API Architecture: RESTful APIs
•	Authentication: Firebase Authentication (server-side token verification)
•	Database: Firebase Firestore / Firebase Realtime Database
•	ORM: Firebase Admin SDK (for database operations)
•	Task Queue: Celery / Redis (for background tasks)
•	Caching: Redis / Memcached
•	File Storage: Firebase Storage (for resources and uploads)
•	Code Execution: Docker containers / Sandbox environment (for code testing and evaluation)
•	AI/ML: Python libraries (scikit-learn, TensorFlow, PyTorch) for recommendations and analytics
•	Testing: pytest / unittest (recommended)



Authentication
•	Service: Firebase Authentication
•	Features:
•	Email/password authentication
•	Social login (Google, GitHub, etc.)
•	User session management
•	Token-based authentication for API requests
•	Role-based access control (if needed)


Database
•	Service: Firebase Firestore / Firebase Realtime Database
•	Features:
•	NoSQL document-based database (Firestore)
•	Real-time data synchronization
•	Scalable and serverless
•	Integration with Firebase Authentication
•	Offline support
•	Security rules for data access control



DevOps & Infrastructure
•	Version Control: Git / GitHub / GitLab
•	CI/CD: GitHub Actions / GitLab CI / Jenkins
•	Containerization: Docker
•	Orchestration: Docker Compose / Kubernetes (for scaling)
•	Cloud Platform: Google Cloud (for Firebase integration) / AWS / Azure (as needed)
•	Monitoring: Prometheus / Grafana / ELK Stack
•	Logging: Python logging / Loguru


Additional Libraries & Tools
•	Frontend:
•	axios / fetch for HTTP requests
•	react-hook-form for form management
•	chart.js / recharts for data visualization
•	monaco-editor / codemirror for code editing
•	framer-motion for animations
•	tailwindcss for styling
•	typescript for type safety
•	Backend:
•	fastapi / django / flask for API development
•	firebase-admin for Firebase integration (Authentication, Firestore, Storage)
•	celery for background tasks
•	redis for caching and task queuing
•	docker for code execution environment
•	pytest for testing

